{"results":[{"url":"https://politifact.com/article/2026/nov/03/election-day-midterm-live-fact-check-vote-results/","final_url":"https://politifact.com/article/2026/nov/03/election-day-midterm-live-fact-check-vote-results/","title":"2026 Midterm Election Day: Live fact-checks and updates","description":"PolitiFact is live fact-checking Election Day 2026. Follow our updates to get the latest facts on voting as the polls open. ","language":"en","text":"# 2026 midterm elections: Live fact-checks as Democrats flip key Senate, House seats\n\nDemocrats Abdul El-Sayed, left, James Talarico, center, and Troy Jackson, right, won key seats to control the U.S. Senate in the 2026 midterm elections. (AP photos)\n\nBy\n\nPolitiFact Staff \n  \n\nNovember 3, 2026\n\nDuring the 2026 midterm elections, Democrats have won a majority in the U.S. Senate, according to media outlet projections.\n\nRepublicans entered Election Day with a 53-47 lead in the Senate. But Democrats flipped seats in Ohio, North Carolina, South Carolina, Iowa, Kansas and Texas all before midnight EST; by early Wednesday morning, they had flipped a longheld Republican Senate seat in Maine and secured another in Michigan. \n\nPolitiFact has been covering key races and fact-checking claims about the candidates and voting. Follow this live blog for our latest updates.\n\n##### **Our Sources**\n\nSee links in live blog.","author":"PolitiFact Staff","published_date":"2026-11-03T20:30:05-05:00","latency_ms":2363.654492000933,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}